# The menus by keys on a desktop (1280 x 800) and today's Daily Glow (generated on the worker) solved by the
# hint key: the cursor moved with the arrows, a cross with X, then hints until the picture shows; the results.
# viewport 1280x800@1
until 600 Read the clues
frames 10
key Enter 1
until 120 Choose a mode
frames 10
key ArrowDown 1
frames 3
key ArrowDown 1
frames 3
key Enter 1
until 900 Row 1, column 1, unknown
frames 150
key Escape 1
until 120 The board waits
frames 10
save pause-keys
click =Leave puzzle
until 120 Read the clues
frames 10
click =Daily Glow
until 900 Row 1, column 1, unknown
frames 150
key ArrowRight 1
frames 3
key ArrowDown 1
frames 3
key KeyX 1
frames 5
expect Row 2, column 2, crossed
save daily-board
repeat 6000 until Picture revealed
  key KeyH 1
  frames 4
end
frames 20
save daily-results
expect Daily streak: 1 day(s).
click =Back to title
until 120 Today: scored
frames 10
save title-after-daily
